* medium → learning repair
* high → trauma/failure overfitting

That gives us another RFHL-level primitive:

\boxed{\text{Operator Thermostat}}

Not just which operator?

But:

How hard should this operator run right now?

And Re-Mark itself can become the mechanism used to discover those controls.

